test-slot: Grant in request order. Before each grant read the current status of all suite tasks and any previous answers. A grant reserves the slot until that worker explicitly reports that its suite finished and released it. Answer waiting requesters with the exact task they wait for, rather than holding for the captain. A renewed request does not bypass an existing reservation or change the request order. At most two full suites may run during the day, but this is an overnight lab: at most ONE full suite at once overnight.
